# <name> <socks-port> <magicdns-suffix> [canary host:port]
#
# The HTTP proxy listens on the SOCKS port plus one. Leave the suffix as "-"
# and `polytail up` fills it in after the first login. The canary is a host:port
# that should always answer, dialled by `polytail ping`.
work     1055  tailbbbbbb.ts.net  build01:22
client-a 1065  tailcccccc.ts.net  gateway:22
